Things to handle
Removing an item that doesn't exist.
Calculating total per item (price * qty) and grand total across all items.


Bonus (optional)
If the same item is added twice, update its quantity instead of creating a duplicate entry (hint: this requires checking and rebuilding the tuple, since tuples can't be modified directly — you'd need to remove the old tuple and add a new one, or convert the cart to use a different structure for that one item).


